WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.499 --> 00:00:03.275
-[Uzi]: 'Sup, losers??
Uzi here!

00:00:03.275 --> 00:00:05.696
Ready to yell and break stuff!

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.023
[cackles]

00:00:07.448 --> 00:00:09.200
-[Pomni]: [uninspired]
And me.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.181
Pomni.

00:00:10.181 --> 00:00:13.275
Your favorite mentally sound jester.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.340
-[Uzi]: Today is BLACK FRIDAY!!!!

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.743
Or, was it yesterday?

00:00:19.743 --> 00:00:21.595
Uh, I-I dunno what day it is.

00:00:22.012 --> 00:00:24.522
-[Pomni]: As such, we've got some...

00:00:24.522 --> 00:00:27.309
super cute items for you.

00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:28.631
-[Uzi]: "Cute items"?

00:00:28.631 --> 00:00:31.389
Try MEGA KILLER DEATH ITEMS!!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.166
[cackling]
[thunder crashes]

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.835
Tremble helplessly

00:00:34.835 --> 00:00:38.020
before this sick-as-hell N statue!

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:39.844
What could be more awesome?

00:00:39.844 --> 00:00:41.372
-[N]: "Go Fish" is pretty awesome!

00:00:41.372 --> 00:00:42.917
[thunder crashes]

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:45.347
-[Pomni]: Uhhh, that's cool.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.177
But w-w-wait till you see

00:00:48.177 --> 00:00:50.020
OUR big-ticket item!

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:51.629
[inhales sharply]

00:00:51.629 --> 00:00:54.218
[whispering]
Caine, what's our big-ticket item?

00:00:54.218 --> 00:00:55.486
[shwing!]

00:00:58.046 --> 00:00:59.330
-[Uzi]: It happens.

00:01:00.046 --> 00:01:01.044
-[Pomni]: CAINE!!

00:01:01.044 --> 00:01:02.833
I want my [doink!] thumbs back!

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:05.322
You'd better not make me run
on that wheely thing or --

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:08.812
or -- or make me stuff my cheeks
with those little rat pellets!

00:01:08.812 --> 00:01:11.667
-[Uzi]: Can you pause your breakdown
and finish your script?

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:13.233
I don't have all day.
-[Pomni]: [inhales sharply]

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:16.694
Do you have any idea how humiliating this is?

00:01:16.694 --> 00:01:17.945
Get me a tiny phone!

00:01:17.945 --> 00:01:19.208
I need to call somebody!

00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:20.665
This is ridiculous!

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.386
And what's with this constant urge to dig?

00:01:22.386 --> 00:01:23.326
-[Uzi]: [sighs]
And what's with this constant urge to dig?

00:01:23.326 --> 00:01:25.452
I've gotta do everything, don't I?

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:28.614
Uh, for this Black Friday,

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:33.141
we got some, uh, dangerous,
killer Digital Circus items for you!

00:01:33.141 --> 00:01:36.484
Born of ancient horrors and gelatin,

00:01:36.484 --> 00:01:39.240
this squishy beast wants nothing more

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.540
than to MURDER YOUR WHOLE FAMILY

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:43.768
IN COLD BLOOD!!!

00:01:43.768 --> 00:01:45.936
-[Gummigoo]:
A bit of an exaggeration there, mate.

00:01:45.936 --> 00:01:47.469
But I am squishy.

00:01:47.469 --> 00:01:48.770
-[Pomni]: [sobbing]
I don't want to be a hamster!

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:50.164
I don't want to be a hamster!

00:01:50.164 --> 00:01:51.680
I don't want to be a hamster!!

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:52.480
[whack!]
Ow.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:53.818
Okay, okay.

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.101
Uh, what is this?

00:01:56.101 --> 00:01:57.915
We got a...

00:01:57.915 --> 00:01:59.473
Murder Drones mat?

00:01:59.473 --> 00:02:01.743
It's definitely not cute.

00:02:01.743 --> 00:02:03.435
It's, uh...

00:02:03.435 --> 00:02:04.458
scary.

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:06.791
And... death.

00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:09.802
Yeah, totally wouldn't use this
to play cute farming games with.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:11.898
-[Uzi]: We beheaded a rabbit

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:13.991
and turned it into a BAG!

00:02:13.991 --> 00:02:18.349
The perfect place to hide
all your AGONY and ANGST!!!

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.932
And here?

00:02:19.932 --> 00:02:21.726
The rabbit's son.

00:02:21.726 --> 00:02:24.206
Wide-eyed and trembling...

00:02:24.206 --> 00:02:27.330
watching as you fashionably strut around

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.604
with his DAD'S HEAD!!!

00:02:29.604 --> 00:02:32.101
-[Jax]: Eh, still beats
Caine's dumb adventures.

00:02:32.101 --> 00:02:33.646
-[Caine]: You're a dumb adventure!
-[Jax]: AGH!

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.143
-[Pomni]:
And then, there's this...

00:02:36.804 --> 00:02:40.774
...terrifying, nasty-looking robot statue thing.

00:02:40.774 --> 00:02:44.147
-[N]: [heartbroken]
You... think I'm... nasty?

00:02:44.147 --> 00:02:46.147
-[Pomni]: Yes. I mean, n-no!
-[N]: [sobbing]

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.343
-[Pomni]: I meant, like...

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:50.751
in a -- in a nasty,
g-gritty metal...

00:02:50.751 --> 00:02:53.280
bodacious sort of way?

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.677
-[N]: [cheerful]
Oh, cool! Okay!

00:02:54.677 --> 00:02:56.677
[chuckles]
I'm not actually a statue, by the way.

00:02:56.677 --> 00:02:58.677
I'm just standing veeeery still,

00:02:58.677 --> 00:03:00.311
and it hurts so bad!

00:03:00.311 --> 00:03:03.507
-[Uzi]: And, available only
for a limited time,

00:03:03.507 --> 00:03:08.164
this vinyl spins with
the tortured wails of the damned.

00:03:08.164 --> 00:03:11.760
Each note a scream of despair!

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.913
[cheerful, goofy music plays]

00:03:14.913 --> 00:03:17.343
Hell incarnate.

00:03:17.343 --> 00:03:19.178
Available only for a limited time.

00:03:19.692 --> 00:03:23.418
-[N]: [chuckles] And that's why you should
never drink a giraffe's milk after Christmas!

00:03:23.418 --> 00:03:26.037
-[Pomni]: [laughing nervously]
Hey, look!

00:03:26.037 --> 00:03:27.300
-[Uzi]: Huh?? [wails]

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:30.290
-[Pomni]:
A cute and cuddly robot plushie

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:32.842
perfect for snuggling on chilly nights.

00:03:32.842 --> 00:03:33.852
-[Uzi]: Wait!

00:03:33.852 --> 00:03:36.808
Y-You think I'm cute and cuddly?

00:03:37.696 --> 00:03:39.014
UGH, that's super cringe!

00:03:39.014 --> 00:03:41.014
What are you trying to do --
ruin my brand?!

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.791
-[Pomni]: I was just saying --
-[Uzi]: I cant have my fans thinking

00:03:42.791 --> 00:03:45.060
I'm some soft-shelled taco like you!

00:03:45.065 --> 00:03:47.355
-[Pomni]: Did you fall out of bed
on the wrong side this morning?

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:50.377
Or did someone spike your coffee
with crybaby pills?!

00:03:50.377 --> 00:03:51.213
-[Uzi]: How about I --

00:03:51.213 --> 00:03:53.990
-[Pomni]: You're literally being
a squishy baby right now!

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:55.413
-[Uzi]: You know what?
Shut up!

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:56.982
-[Pomni]: YOU shut up!
-[Uzi]: You shut up!

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.626
-[Pomni]: You shut up!
-[Uzi]: Ugh! You shut up!

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.915
-[Pomni]: I'm not shutting up,
and I'm done talking to you!

00:04:01.915 --> 00:04:03.222
-[Uzi]: Shut up!
-[Pomni]: La-la-la-la-la --

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.515
-[Uzi]: I'm done. I'm done with this.
-[Pomni]: I cant hear anything you're saying!!

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.017
I'm calling my lawyer!!
-[Pomni]: I cant hear anything you're saying!!

00:04:06.017 --> 00:04:07.880
La-la-la-la-la!
[door opens, slams shut]

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.671
La-la-la-la-la!!!

00:04:10.937 --> 00:04:13.240
Can I be turned back to normal now?

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.524
[shwing!]

